----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
🤔 What is Dictionary?
Think of Dictionary as a Contact Book 📒

Dictionary = Key Value store in Python!
Every API response, config file & cloud response
comes back as a Dictionary! 🚀
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
📊 List vs Tuple vs Dictionary

Feature        List               Tuple              Dictionary
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Syntax         [ ]                ( )                { }

Access by      Index [0]          Index [0]          Key ['name']

Changeable     ✅ Yes             ❌ No              ✅ Yes

Ordered        ✅ Yes             ✅ Yes             ✅ Yes

Duplicates     ✅ Yes             ✅ Yes             ❌ Keys unique

Use for        Collection         Fixed data         Key value data
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
📊 Summary Table

Task            Code
--------------------------------------------------------------
Create          d = {'key': 'value'}

Access          d['key']

Safe access     d.get('key', 'default')

Add/Update      d['key'] = 'value'

Delete          del d['key']

All keys        d.keys()

All values      d.values()

All pairs       d.items()

Loop            for k, v in d.items()

Check key       if 'key' in d

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Contact Book:
Name    → Phone Number
"John"  → "9876543210"
"Alice" → "1234567890"
"Bob"   → "5555555555"

Dictionary:
Key   →  Value
"name" → "myapp"
"port" → 8080
"env"  → "production"

# Dictionary uses { } curly brackets
